1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,850
Luigi! Here! Look up!

2
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:11,380
Need a second?

3
00:00:11,730 --> 00:00:13,130
Just room.

4
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:19,380
Watch the chain.

5
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:33,140
They want the form again. I already sent it. I've got the receipt.

6
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:49,000
Keep that receipt. Ask the clinic for a list of the attachments. And cover your address before you post.

7
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:57,810
I know you've been calling. I'm—

8
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:09,830
I'm all right. I'll call you when I can.

9
00:01:16,600 --> 00:01:18,000
Housekeeping. Towels?

10
00:01:18,350 --> 00:01:19,750
No, thanks.

11
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:39,940
We can still make the number if we freeze hiring. Reviews will take longer, though. I need you to sign off.

12
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:46,550
And if we don't freeze it?

13
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:57,260
We miss the quarter. Those are the choices I've got.

14
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:03,830
Then freeze hiring till the end of the quarter.

15
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:09,400
Monday, send me the wait times. In days.

16
00:02:14,600 --> 00:02:18,760
Saturday's fine. What time did your mom say?

17
00:02:19,590 --> 00:02:23,270
No, don't put her on. Text me.

18
00:02:33,600 --> 00:02:37,760
Tell me about the plane. I'm heading out.

19
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:53,830
Not that one. Just wait by the door, please.

20
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:02,830
Saturday. I said Saturday. What happened to the wing?

21
00:03:13,600 --> 00:03:20,620
Leave it on my desk. Not the kitchen table. We can fix it Saturday.

22
00:03:40,600 --> 00:03:48,090
Get the footage from before the shots, too. I want to see him coming in.
